DocStudioFamilyHelpEditPdf = The editor of DocStudio annotates (text, drawing, highlight, image), rotates, deletes and reorders pages, crops and redacts, without any server. Redaction turns the pages concerned into images (their text can no longer be selected) and then checks that the hidden text is gone. The editor is offered only to the users who may change the documents of the object.
